        <activityName xml:lang="en">Concrete for building construction, only common base, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Concrete for building construction, only common base, at plant
based on ecoinvent 3.2 dataset;
UUID: 509b1c64-78e4-3132-864b-162ea9a6ac18
Without the ingredients for the concrete at the factory gate. Includes the whole manufacturing processes to produce ready-mixed concrete and infrastructure. No administration is included.
Location: Unspecified
Technology: Data from the Amt für Hochbauten, Stadt Zürich. Data approximates average swiss production
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Measured data of several Swiss plants, intended to be representative for the Swiss production volume 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_509b1c64-78e4-3132-864b-162ea9a6ac18.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
